Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)

Package: pve-triton-stack
Architecture: all
Depends: pve-triton-dxvk, pve-triton-virglrenderer, pve-triton-qemu, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Triton/Neptune D3D11 stack for Proxmox VE (meta package)
 Meta package tying together the Triton host stack: pve-triton-dxvk
 (host D3D11 renderer), pve-triton-virglrenderer (Neptune render
 server) and pve-triton-qemu (Neptune-capable virtio-gpu). Provides
 /usr/bin/pve-triton-qemu, which wires up LD_LIBRARY_PATH and the
 NPT_*_LIBRARY_PATH host-backend variables from /etc/pve-triton/env
 before exec'ing the forked QEMU. Coexists with pve-qemu-kvm.
